  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 180°C conventional / 160°C fan. Grease and line a 2 lb loaf tin (approximately 23 × 13 cm)."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add 200 g softened butter and 180 g caster sugar to mixing bowl. Mix 40 sec / speed 4, then scrape down.",
