          "unit": "g"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, gently toss 150 g fresh raspberries with 10 g plain flour. Fold these and 120 g white chocolate chunks into cake batter by hand with spatula, to avoid crushing berries.",
      "ingredientLinks": [
        {
          "match": "150 g fresh raspberries",
