          "match": "120 g white chocolate",
          "ingredientIndex": 7,
          "amount": 120,
          "unit": "g"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to prepared tin, level top and bake 55–65 minutes at 160°C fan / 180°C conventional. Check after 50 minutes; skewer in sponge should have no wet batter. Cover loosely with foil if browning too quickly."
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool in tin for 15 minutes, then transfer to wire rack and cool completely."
    },
    {
      "text": "For topping, clean and dry mixing bowl. Add 100 g white chocolate and chop 5 sec / speed 7.",
